# Ammo works: packs stone (brought by workers) and light (its light link to a store in reach) into MUNITIONS - light
# charges for the cannons - in its own buffer (StructureSystem::tickProduction); workers take them to the Ammo stores and
# the Cannons. Needs workers. A 4x3x4 m box (2x2 cells). Spawned origin 1.5 above the ground.
# SHAPE (a placeholder; uniform scales of the baseshapes variants): a stone workshop (the root), a dark slate roof, a
# chimney, and a rack of three pale charging crystals in front. The child pieces are render-only.
